      "title": "Persist events synchronously in the redirect transaction",
      "rationale": "A successful redirect must reliably create exactly one associated event without external infrastructure. The event and legacy count remain consistent on commit or rollback together.",
      "alternatives": [
        "Asynchronous event publication",
        "Best-effort event insertion after the response"
